# R3016 CVTRPGSRC pub400.com
      * Form length 20, overflow line 15, headings again on overflow.
     H
     FQSYSPRT   O    F   80        PRINTER OFLIND(*INOF)
     F                                     FORMLEN(20)
     F                                     FORMOFL(15)
     C                   EXCEPT    HEAD
     C     1             DO        25            I                 3 0
     C                   EXCEPT    DET
     C   OF              EXCEPT    HEAD
     C   OF              SETOFF                                       OF
     C                   END
     C                   SETON                                        LR
     OQSYSPRT   E            HEAD           2  2
     O                                           20 'HEADING'
     O                       PAGE          Z     30
     OQSYSPRT   E            DET            1
     O                                            8 'LINE'
     O                       I             Z     12
     OQSYSPRT   T    LR                  2
     O                                           12 'END'
